---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<footer class="wiki-footer" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <div><span class="footer-logo"><Icon name="layers" size={17} />DevWiki</span><p>知識會更新，理解會累積。</p></div>
  <div class="footer-actions"><a href="/offline/">離線閱讀與安裝</a><span>繁體中文 · C# 專題</span></div>
</footer>
<div class="pwa-update" id="pwa-update" hidden role="status" aria-live="polite">
  <span>有新的知識庫版本，可以更新了。</span>
  <button class="button-primary small" type="button" id="pwa-update-button">更新並重新載入</button>
  <button class="icon-button" type="button" id="pwa-update-dismiss" aria-label="稍後更新"><Icon name="close" size={17} /></button>
</div>
<div class="toast" id="site-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
